{"unit_id":"full-aigc-plugins__blender-design-plugin#feature-1","repo":"full-aigc-plugins/blender-design-plugin","commit":"691b2702b1fbdb338dd8efd3096e04aa1e49dd96","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Blender Design 的功能「场景检查」：读取当前 Blender 场景中的对象、集合、相机、帧范围和材质等信息。通过场景检查技能触发，返回场景状态供后续设计或修改前核对。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/blender-inspect/SKILL.md:1"]}
{"unit_id":"full-aigc-plugins__blender-design-plugin#feature-2","repo":"full-aigc-plugins/blender-design-plugin","commit":"691b2702b1fbdb338dd8efd3096e04aa1e49dd96","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Blender Design 的功能「多视角预览」：为当前场景捕获相机、正面、侧面和顶视 PNG；动画里程碑还会采集首帧、中间帧和末帧。通过预览技能按当前修订生成图像。","source":"generated","evidence":["scripts/harness/preview.py:26","skills/blender-preview/SKILL.md:1"]}
